1	//! Service <-> GUI protocol: newline-delimited JSON over a loopback TCP socket.
2	//!
3	//! The service writes `ipc.json` (port + random token) into the data dir; the
4	//! GUI reads it, connects to 127.0.0.1 and authenticates with the token before
5	//! anything else is accepted.
